{"unit_id":"moguiyu__dsh-tavily#card-zh","repo":"moguiyu/dsh-tavily","commit":"74d395843f63c1cb0ba89c5cc78c1141585ead75","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Tavily**（DSH Web 插件）：为 DSH 添加基于 Tavily 的搜索和资料获取能力。插件注册 tavily_search、tavily_extract、tavily_map、tavily_crawl、tavily_research 与 tavily_get_research 六个工具，并在 Plugins 配置页提供密钥管理、用量查看和密钥策略设置。搜索支持新闻时效、域名筛选和结果内容；调研工具可生成带引用的综合报告。适合需要联网检索、读取网页或汇总多来源资料的 DSH 用户。需要 Tavily API Key；原生 web_search 保持不变。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-tavily/src/tools.js:905-1118","packages/dsh-tavily/src/client.js:685-700","packages/dsh-tavily/src/index.js:25-38"]}
{"unit_id":"moguiyu__dsh-tavily#card-en","repo":"moguiyu/dsh-tavily","commit":"74d395843f63c1cb0ba89c5cc78c1141585ead75","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**DSH Tavily** (DSH web plugin) adds six Tavily tools for web search, extraction, site mapping and crawling, and cited research reports. Its Plugins card manages keys, shows usage, and sets rotation or account-level load balancing. A Tavily API key is required; built-in web_search stays unchanged.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-tavily/src/tools.js:905-1118","packages/dsh-tavily/src/client.js:685-700","packages/dsh-tavily/src/index.js:25-38"]}
