{"unit_id":"moguiyu__dsh-tavily#feature-search","repo":"moguiyu/dsh-tavily","commit":"74d395843f63c1cb0ba89c5cc78c1141585ead75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tavily 的功能「网页搜索」：tavily_search 调用 Tavily 搜索接口，支持基础或高级深度、新闻主题与天数、域名包含或排除、结果数量以及可选答案和原始内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-tavily/src/tools.js:905-955"]}
{"unit_id":"moguiyu__dsh-tavily#feature-extract","repo":"moguiyu/dsh-tavily","commit":"74d395843f63c1cb0ba89c5cc78c1141585ead75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tavily 的功能「网页内容提取」：tavily_extract 接收一个或多个 HTTP(S) 网页地址，可选提取深度、文本或 Markdown 格式及图片信息，并返回提取内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-tavily/src/tools.js:957-975"]}
{"unit_id":"moguiyu__dsh-tavily#feature-map","repo":"moguiyu/dsh-tavily","commit":"74d395843f63c1cb0ba89c5cc78c1141585ead75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tavily 的功能「网站链接发现」：tavily_map 接收网站地址，通过 Tavily 发现站内 URL，不提取页面正文，便于后续选择页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-tavily/src/tools.js:977-988"]}
{"unit_id":"moguiyu__dsh-tavily#feature-crawl","repo":"moguiyu/dsh-tavily","commit":"74d395843f63c1cb0ba89c5cc78c1141585ead75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tavily 的功能「网站爬取」：tavily_crawl 请求 Tavily 爬取网站发现的页面，并返回页面提取内容；可设置提取深度和返回格式。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-tavily/src/tools.js:990-1007"]}
{"unit_id":"moguiyu__dsh-tavily#feature-research","repo":"moguiyu/dsh-tavily","commit":"74d395843f63c1cb0ba89c5cc78c1141585ead75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tavily 的功能「综合调研」：tavily_research 创建异步研究任务并轮询状态，完成后返回综合引用报告；等待超时可带任务 ID 返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-tavily/src/tools.js:1012-1080"]}
